   00150|  * over `events`, the prompt read from their `impulse` event and the response
   00151|  * link from their last `response` event (`response:<intent>` when none was
   00152|  * logged). Null when the log holds no impulse.
   00153|  * @param {Array<{kind: string, payload?: string}>} events
